  "_palette_note": "b is Bob, brightest because he is the only thing being watched. c is the chair. r is the box, s the sand inside it — the sand is dimmer than the walls so the box reads as something you look into rather than a plank he is standing on, which is what the first attempt looked like. p is the pixilation he goes out in.",
